# Cloudflare Workers static-assets redirect map (BushmanQC).
#
# Evaluation notes (developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/):
#   * One rule per line: [source] [destination] [code]. Lines starting with # are comments.
#   * "Redirects are always followed, regardless of whether or not an asset matches
#     the incoming request." -> these rules win over the automatic
#     html_handling: "auto-trailing-slash" 307s configured in wrangler.jsonc.
#   * "The order of your redirects matter. If there are multiple redirects for the
#     same source path, the top-most redirect is applied." No two sources below
#     collide, and no destination below is also a source, so there are no chains
#     or loops and the grouping is for readability only.
#   * Every rule here is STATIC (no * splat, no :placeholder). If a dynamic rule is
#     ever added it MUST go at the bottom: "Static redirects should appear before
#     dynamic redirects."
#   * Limit is 2,000 static rules; this file uses 27.

# --- 1. Legacy .html URLs -> canonical extensionless URLs -------------------
# Cloudflare's built-in html_handling would only issue temporary 307s; these 301s
# consolidate link equity on the canonical URLs.
/index.html / 301
/about.html /about 301
/mission.html /mission 301
/services.html /services 301
/faq.html /faq 301
/contact.html /contact 301
/terms.html /terms 301
/resources.html /resources 301
/resources/qmsr-transition-checklist.html /resources/qmsr-transition-checklist 301
/resources/fda-21-cfr-820-vs-iso-13485.html /resources/fda-21-cfr-820-vs-iso-13485 301
/resources/qms-cost-medical-device-startup.html /resources/qms-cost-medical-device-startup 301

# --- 2. Trailing-slash variants -> canonical no-slash URLs ------------------
# Without these, auto-trailing-slash answers /about/ with a temporary 307. Every
# page in this site is a single .html file (no folder index files), so the
# canonical form is always the slash-less one.
/about/ /about 301
/mission/ /mission 301
/services/ /services 301
/faq/ /faq 301
/contact/ /contact 301
/terms/ /terms 301
/resources/ /resources 301
/resources/qmsr-transition-checklist/ /resources/qmsr-transition-checklist 301
/resources/fda-21-cfr-820-vs-iso-13485/ /resources/fda-21-cfr-820-vs-iso-13485 301
/resources/qms-cost-medical-device-startup/ /resources/qms-cost-medical-device-startup 301

# --- 3. Legacy pre-redesign URLs still in Google's index --------------------
# Both the slashed and slash-less forms are mapped: the slash-less form matches no
# asset, so without a rule it would fall through to not_found_handling and 404.
/virtual-quality-system-implementation-in-7-steps/ /services 301
/virtual-quality-system-implementation-in-7-steps /services 301
/blog/ /resources 301
/blog /resources 301
